---

<section class="section section--alt" id="why" aria-labelledby="why-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--split">
      <div>
        <p class="section-num">03 · Why inventory</p>
        <h2 id="why-h">Forecasting is the mechanism. Inventory is the outcome.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-sub" data-reveal>
        A successful forecast does not create business value by itself — the decision it enables does.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="duo" data-reveal>
      <div class="duo__panel duo__panel--forecast">
        <p class="mono duo__label">Forecast quality</p>
        <p class="duo__big">How close is the prediction to reality?</p>
        <ul class="duo__list">
          <li>MAE · MSE · RMSE · sMAPE</li>
          <li>MASE / RMSSE where justified</li>
          <li>Measured on the same evaluation periods</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="duo__vs" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="duo__vs-line"></span>
        <span class="duo__vs-word mono">vs.</span>
        <span class="duo__vs-line"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="duo__panel duo__panel--inventory">
        <p class="mono duo__label">Inventory performance</p>
        <p class="duo__big">Does the decision keep the business healthy?</p>
        <ul class="duo__list">
          <li>Total cost · holding · stockouts</li>
          <li>Service level · average inventory</li>
          <li>Simulated under one common policy</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="why-note" data-reveal>
      <p class="mono why-note__label">The core proposition</p>
      <p class="lede">
        A forecast that is slightly less accurate can still produce the better inventory decision — and
        accuracy gains that do not change the decision may not be worth their cost.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section--alt { background: var(--paper-2); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }

  .duo {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--sp-6);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-7);
  }
  @media (min-width: 56rem) {
    .duo { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; }
  }
  .duo__panel {
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
  }
  .duo__panel--forecast { border-top: 3px solid var(--c-traditional); }
  .duo__panel--inventory { border-top: 3px solid var(--c-inventory); }
  .duo__label { color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: var(--sp-3); }
  .duo__panel--forecast .duo__label { color: var(--c-traditional); }
  .duo__panel--inventory .duo__label { color: var(--c-inventory); }
  .duo__big {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.2vw, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
    max-width: 22ch;
  }
  .duo__list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--sp-2);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-sm);
  }
  .duo__list li { padding-left: var(--sp-4); position: relative; }
  .duo__list li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0.55em;
    width: 6px; height: 6px;
    border-radius: 1px;
    background: var(--line-2);
  }
  .duo__vs {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: var(--sp-2);
    align-self: center;
  }
  .duo__vs-line { width: 1px; height: 2.5rem; background: var(--line-2); }
  .duo__vs-word { color: var(--ink-3); font-size: var(--fs-mono-sm); writing-mode: vertical-rl; }

  .why-note {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--c-inventory);
    padding-left: var(--sp-5);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .why-note__label { color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: var(--sp-3); }
</style>